ts=2026-09-24T11:51:42.515Z type=learning scope=frontend/monaco content="Monaco 0.52.2 standalone API: `monaco.CompletionItemKind` is UNDEFINED — it's exposed at `monaco.languages.CompletionItemKind`. In monaco-code-editor.js registerCompletions, code captured `var Kind = monaco.CompletionItemKind`, so `Kind.Variable/Funtion` threw \"Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'Variable')\" inside provideCompletionItems → the whole provider's suggestions silently dropped (Monaco catches per-provider), leaving only word-based suggestions in the widget. Same-line word/clip root: word-based words showed but no $VAR/命令. Fix: `var Kind = monaco.languages.CompletionItemKind || monaco.CompletionItemKind`. Symptoms to watch: providers invoked (counter increments) but itemsLen excludes them; completion model `_items` has only word items; `filtered` matches word count only. Debug technique that worked: wrap each provider's `provideCompletionItems` via `svc.completionProvider.all(model)` to log THROW/RESOLVE (access via editor.getContribution('editor.contrib.suggestController').model._languageFeaturesService). Also: only test on freshly-navigated pages — repeated in-page provider registrations across CDP evals pollute state and make valid code appear broken."
ts=2026-09-24T12:45:30.351Z type=learning scope=testenv content="/tmp/opencode 会周期性被清理（node_modules、脚本、master-key.b64、dm-test.db 都被重置过）。每次会话前需重装 ws@8（cd /tmp/opencode/cdp && npm install --no-save ws@8）并重新准备测试库。Chrome headless 需重启：google-chrome --headless=new --remote-debugging-port=9222 --user-data-dir=/tmp/opencode/chrome --no-sandbox --disable-gpu --no-first-run --disable-background-networking --disable-dev-shm-usage。"
ts=2026-09-24T12:45:36.892Z type=context scope=testenv content="调试基础设施：8080 端口是用户（IDEA dev runner, 无密码）在跑、连自己的 data.db，别动。我自己的测试服务器在 8090（pid 19039，java -jar target/device-manager-1.0.5.jar --server.port=8090 --spring.datasource.url=jdbc:sqlite:/tmp/opencode/dm-test.db，工作目录必须是项目根以读 ./.master-key）。dm-test.db 被重置后 admin 密码是随机生成的，需从 /tmp/opencode/dm8090.log 的 \"Password:\" 行读取（当前为 H%6(ThA*bD）。场景数据（device id1 TestBox + alpha.sh/beta.sh）已在 dm-test.db 里。"
ts=2026-09-24T12:45:45.473Z type=context scope=device-manager-ui content="4 个视觉问题处理进展：(1) 触发方式按钮圆角不对齐→已改 styles.css 全部统一 8px 圆角（去掉 999px 胶囊），已验证四个 inner border-radius:8px；(2) 保存/取消未对齐→.vsc__inspector-actions 改 2 列 grid，验证同 y=727、宽 130；(3) 新建/Explorer 点击覆盖原标签→script-task.js 改为多标签（tabs 数组+activeKey，openEdit 复用已开标签不重复、脏点确认、back 关闭当前标签），debug30 18 项断言全 PASS；(4) 代码提示列表空白→无法在无头 Chrome 复现（浅色/深色/DPR1/2/打字$触发均正常渲染，行文字可见、无 invisible 行），怀疑用户浏览器缓存旧 JS 或环境差异，待用户确认细节。5 个文件改动未 commit（等用户授权）。"
ts=2026-09-24T14:08:19.951Z type=learning scope=device-manager-ui content="根因：styles.css 里有一条全局类选择器 `.main { padding: 34px 28px 64px; ... }`（本意是给页面布局容器 <main class=\"main\"> 用），但它同时命中 Monaco 代码提示候选行内部的 <div class=\"main\">，给每个候选行加了 34/28/64 的内边距，把行撑到 ~98px、文字被挤出高 20px 且 overflow:hidden 的 .contents 盒子，表现为\"候选列表只有背景条没有文字\"（浅色深色都一样）。修复：把选择器限定为 `main.main`（styles.css:562 及 778 的媒体查询），不再泄漏到 Monaco。教训：应用全局样式时避免使用 .main/.left/.right/.contents/.icon 这类 Monaco 内部也在用的通用类名；诊断 Monaco 布局问题要检查 getComputedStyle(el).padding 和 label 是否在祖先 overflow:hidden 裁剪盒内。"
